cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Siril in your work, please cite our article in the
  Journal of Open Source Software using the preferred citation below.
type: software
title: Siril
abstract: >-
  Siril is an open source software package for the pre- and
  post-processing of astronomical images, providing tools for
  calibration, registration, stacking, photometry, astrometry and
  image enhancement.
